(A) UV cross-linking (i) Cross-link DNA to the membrane in a UV cross-linker. Proceed directly with prehybridization.   
(B) Membrane baking (i) Air-dry the membrane and bake in an oven at $80~^{\circ}\complement$ for $2h$ or at $120^{\circ}\mathsf{C}$ for $30~\mathrm{min}$ .  PAUSE POINT The membrane can be air-dried and stored between two sheets of Whatman paper at RT for several months.
