52| Remove membrane from the tube and drain the excess fluid. Wrap damp membrane in plastic wrap. Immobilize membrane (tape firmly) in an autoradiography cassette with intensifying screens. Place an X-ray film over the membrane in the dark room. Expose at $\mathtt{-80}^{\circ}\mathtt{C}$ for at least overnight.
